//   DPI calculations        → ELIMINATED (vectors are resolution-independent)
//
// WHAT STAYS:
//
//   panelizer-step-scan     → Still scans render for panel regions
//   panelizer-step-stamp    → Adds metadata to EPS (minor mod)
//   panelizer-step-proof    → Generates proof sheet from EPS
//   Overlay screenshot gen  → ALREADY EXISTS — now serves dual purpose
//   Vehicle dims database   → ALREADY EXISTS — feeds SIZE step
//
