//
//   Gemini extraction:    ~$0.04 × 7 = $0.28 (vision + image gen)
//   Vectorizer.AI:        ~$1.00 × 7 = $7.00 (production mode)
//   ─────────────────────────────────────────
//   Total:                         ~$7.28/vehicle
//
//   vs. current: $0.49 + 30-60 min manual cleanup
//   vs. manual designer: $500-975 per design
